 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "0fd41b4f4e2094c1b1622d4a074ab0ab4477be88c745a0abf4fd06a6baeb81af",
   "seconds": 1.939,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "275feb4b4cf50c8382004c6fe45bc2e3a2a0a8896dbf74a4334923332ce3d76b",
   "seconds": 3.028,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "e9109d4288a55ae2743f9c37ebd4ff6095193b61414aa5b86895e09637565c25",
   "seconds": 3.445,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "eb47891127e869bd362e09e743e9c374de077545c4b2495bef16e9f0487ac92b",
   "seconds": 3.67,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "b7d48a9289e38e3513fb190cf157425f8f002e30cbff5766c662bb7a767db6fe",
   "seconds": 2.717,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "292ee574e58d088cfe8b552afaebb082f706c44e7366f975eabe0a22bd7b1ba8",
   "seconds": 3.773,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "b3aa18cf1a033e89d27b31daa43f135cd4d752c021104af9a70c8238f8fad0cc",
   "seconds": 4.837,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "6d9b9214dd78fa911d7a652620544a17933b056ae497d309f762bedefe9c4e82",
   "seconds": 2.251,
   "pause_ms": 266
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "9bd279cc9462719722fbc4aa84f0cd75e6e41a00414ee83741e63175940eb449",
   "seconds": 2.895,
   "pause_ms": 380
  }
 ],
